# Data — never commit Seurat objects, raw counts, or results.
# As of 2026-09-06 the datasets live OUTSIDE this repo, in the directory named by
# SHARED_DIR (see .env.example). These rules are kept as a safety net so that a stray
# download into the repo is still ignored.
*.h5Seurat
*.h5Seurat.old
*.h5ad
*.loom
*.rds
*.tar
*.mtx
*.mtx.gz
local_data/

# Per-study data AND analysis scripts both live in $SHARED_DIR, outside this repo, and
# were untracked here on 2026-09-07. GSE233866 (mouse SNc/VTA atlas) and GSE243639 (human)
# are downloadable from GEO. Earlier revisions of the R scripts remain in git history:
# git checkout 4e8e769 -- DATA_GSE233866/ DATA_UNZIPPED/
# These rules are a safety net so a stray copy back into the repo stays ignored.
DATA_UNZIPPED/
DATA_GSE233866/
GSE243639_Clinical_data.csv
hdwgcna_out/

# Analysis outputs moved to $SHARED_DIR/analysis_results/ on 2026-09-06 and untracked
